    narr:narration """The winter consolidation thread runs from [the Saturday-only tool library schedule, grounded in six weeks of thin weekday turnout](narr:Expr_20261009_3_Batch3Rota20261009041528_h24ff99af2344_1) to [a directive follow-up assigning a second volunteer to the Saturday shift for returns](narr:Expr_20261009_3_Batch3Rota20261009041528_h24ff99af2344_2). Both children carry decision-level conviction: one states the evidence for cutting hours, the other states the staffing reinforcement that follows.""" ;
